{"assetType":"character_single_image","contentId":"character.seojin.1","contentUsage":"인게임 전투와 캐릭터 선택 화면에서 목표 4.25-head 젊은 성인 실루엣, 열린 먹선, 넓은 여백, 낮은 상투·단순한 한쪽 어깨 갑옷 mass·왼쪽 허리 환도를 읽는 단일 전신 이미지","domainType":"character","identityConsistencyLock":{"identityId":"character.seojin.1","referenceFacts":[{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v10"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/genderPresentation"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v10"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/body"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.face.v10"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/face"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.hair.v10"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/hair"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v10"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/costume"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.equipment.v10"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/equipment"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.weapon.v10"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/weapon"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.handedness.v10"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/handedness"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.palette.v10"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/palette"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.materials.v10"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/materials"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.identifying_features.v10"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/identifyingFeatures"}]},"planningSnapshot":{"approvedFacts":[{"factId":"seojin.canonical.single_image_readiness","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/act-plans/player/character.seojin.1.json","sourcePointer":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/readiness","value":"ready"},{"factId":"seojin.canonical.character_id","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/act-plans/player/character.seojin.1.json","sourcePointer":"/identity/characterId","value":"character.seojin.1"},{"factId":"seojin.canonical.character_type","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/act-plans/player/character.seojin.1.json","sourcePointer":"/identity/characterType","value":"Player"},{"factId":"seojin.canonical.runtime_domain","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/act-plans/player/character.seojin.1.json","sourcePointer":"/identity/runtimeDomain","value":"character"},{"factId":"seojin.canonical.planning_status","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/act-plans/player/character.seojin.1.json","sourcePointer":"/planningStatus","value":"approved"},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.body.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.body.v10/value","value":{"description":"최우선 conformance fact는 전신 4.0–5.0 heads 범위와 목표 4.25 heads의 compact young-adult 실루엣이다. 머리 높이는 상투를 제외한 cranial mass 상단부터 턱 아래까지, 전신 높이는 cranial mass 상단부터 가장 낮은 weight-bearing sole까지 측정하고 fullBodyHeight/headHeight로 판정한다. 젊은 성인 팔다리는 압축·단순화하되 아동형이 아니며 자연주의 7-head 이상 장신, 6.5–8등신 또는 영웅적 해부를 금지한다."}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.costume.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.costume.v10/value","value":{"description":"빛바랜 군졸복과 회갈색 여행 겉옷을 넓은 여백과 소수의 열린 먹선으로 단순화한다. 복식은 실루엣과 큰 층만 식별하고 garment microfold, 반복 봉제선, fastener 또는 조밀한 표면 정보를 열거하지 않는다."}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.equipment.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.equipment.v10/value","value":[{"description":"한쪽 어깨 갑옷은 one broad dusty gray-brown pigment mass와 끊긴 identity edge 하나의 단순 shoulder form으로만 읽힌다. 개별 plate, scale, rivet, lacing, fastener, microtexture, 사실적 재질 또는 modeled lighting을 금지한다."},{"description":"작은 utility pouch 하나는 muted ochre의 작은 accent anchor로만 유지하고 small travel accessory는 dusty gray-brown 보조 anchor로 분리하되 표면 미세 디테일을 추가하지 않는다."}]},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.face.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.face.v10/value","value":{"description":"젊은 성인 한국 남성의 깨끗한 턱선, 곧은 눈썹과 차분한 시선을 소수의 high-signal 열린 mok-seon으로만 읽힌다. 사실적 얼굴 모델링, 피부 명암, 미세질감, 촘촘한 내부선 또는 아동형 둥근 얼굴을 금지한다."}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v10/value","value":{"description":"20대 중후반의 젊은 성인 한국 남성으로 명확히 읽히며 미성년·아동처럼 보이지 않는다. compact 4.25-head target 안에서 조선시대 군졸 출신 떠돌이 검사의 실용적이고 절제된 young-adult silhouette를 유지한다."}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.hair.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.hair.v10/value","value":{"description":"검은 머리를 낮고 단정한 조선식 상투로 묶는다. 상투는 가변 압력의 열린 먹선과 넓은 미채색 여백으로 식별하며 불투명 검정 면, 균일한 닫힌 외곽 또는 사실적 모발 미세선을 금지한다."}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.handedness.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.handedness.v10/value","value":"right"},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.identifying_features.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.identifying_features.v10/value","value":["cranial-mass-to-chin/head-to-weight-bearing-sole로 측정되는 4.0–5.0 heads 범위의 목표 4.25-head 젊은 성인 비례","젊은 성인 한국 남성의 단순화된 얼굴과 차분한 시선","낮고 단정한 조선식 상투","한쪽 어깨의 one broad broken-edge dusty gray-brown armor mass","왼쪽 허리에 완전히 칼집에 든 조선식 환도와 손잡이에 얹은 오른손"]},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v10/value","value":{"assetType":"character_single_image","backgroundPolicy":"transparent","detailDensity":{"description":"Identity silhouette before surface detail. Target 4.25 heads inside the accepted 4.0–5.0 range; omit 35–55% of expected silhouette/internal boundaries targeting 45%; keep figure interior and full canvas each at least 70% achromatic or unpainted. Use only a few broad rough pigment masses and one broad broken-edge shoulder-armor mass. Prohibit realistic face modeling, plates, scales, rivets, lacing, fasteners, garment microfolds, microtexture, modeled lighting, and realistic material rendering.","level":"exact"},"framingPolicy":"centered full-body head-to-toe with generous clear space; no crop","outputUsage":"인게임 전투와 캐릭터 선택 화면에서 목표 4.25-head 젊은 성인 실루엣, 열린 먹선, 넓은 여백, 낮은 상투·단순한 한쪽 어깨 갑옷 mass·왼쪽 허리 환도를 읽는 단일 전신 이미지","providerCanvasPolicy":"profile_owned_technical_canvas","targetDisplaySize":{"consumerViewportOrReference":"인게임 전투 카메라와 캐릭터 선택 화면에서 전신 높이 96~144px로 표시되는 단일 캐릭터 이미지","minimumPixelSize":{"height":96,"width":64},"targetPixelSize":{"height":144,"width":96},"unit":"px"}}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.materials.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.materials.v10/value","value":[{"appliesTo":"얼굴·상투·복식·한쪽 어깨 갑옷·오른손과 왼쪽 허리 환도의 열린 식별 경계","materialDescription":"open and broken pressure-variable tactile mok-seon with visible brush start, directional drag, dry end, directional weight, and broad negative space"},{"appliesTo":"승인된 faded blue-gray/indigo, dusty gray-brown, small muted-ochre palette anchors only","materialDescription":"few broad rough watercolor and pastel masses with bounded controlled bleed and misalignment beyond selected contour edges; no modeled light or realistic material rendering"}]},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.palette.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.palette.v10/value","value":[{"appliesTo":"군졸복 목깃·허리·띠와 칼집에 든 환도 손잡이의 제한된 primary cool broad marks","colorDescription":"faded blue-gray/indigo"},{"appliesTo":"여행 겉옷, one broad broken-edge shoulder-armor mass와 small travel accessory의 제한된 secondary earth broad marks","colorDescription":"dusty gray-brown"},{"appliesTo":"small utility pouch와 선택된 작은 수선 지점에만 쓰는 small warm accent","colorDescription":"muted ochre"}]},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.pose_policy.single_image.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.pose_policy.single_image.v10/value","value":{"description":"Natural front three-quarter full-body stance, neutral but ready to move, with the right hand resting lightly on the hilt of the fully sheathed hwando at the left waist; one viewpoint only. The style-only raster supplies no person, pose, action, clothing, or equipment semantics.","mode":"exact"}},{"factId":"seojin.appearance.weapon.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.appearance.weapon.v10/value","value":{"description":"오른손잡이용 장식 없는 조선식 환도 한 자루를 왼쪽 허리에 완전히 칼집에 둔다. 오른손은 손잡이에 가볍게 얹고 칼집과 손잡이는 열린 가변압 먹선과 제한된 faded indigo 또는 dusty gray-brown anchor로 읽힌다. 사실적 금속, 장식 미세선, modeled lighting 또는 reference-person transfer를 금지한다.","present":true}},{"factId":"seojin.single_image.expression_profile_key.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v10.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.single_image.expression_profile_key.v10/value","value":"projectbs_character_open_ink_wash_dynamic_contour@2.0.0"},{"factId":"seojin.single_image.identity_consistency_lock.v10","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.se